# Stretched, looping, held C5 (+12): the voice writes a sample cache and switches to reading it at the first loop
# end. A pitch bend well after that changes the phase increment the cache was written for, so the voice stops
# reading it and crossfades out of it into a fresh stretcher.
4608 90 48 64
30000 E0 00 50
80000 80 48 40
